data: {"candidates": [{"content": {"parts": [{"text": "**Describing \"Abacus\"**\n\nI'm now focusing on describing the \"Abacus\" variety based on the provided text. I've noted it's a late-maturing, spring-type, hexaploid triticale. I'm carefully detailing its characteristics, like brown chaff, long heads, and pigmented flag leaf auricles. Also, the text includes a comparison to other varieties, which I am summarizing, such as head length or resistance to specific diseases. I'm also capturing its origin and pedigree information.\n\n\n","thought": true}],"role": "model"},"index": 0}],"usageMetadata": {"promptTokenCount": 2362,"totalTokenCount": 4243,"promptTokensDetails": [{"modality": "TEXT","tokenCount": 178},{"modality": "IMAGE","tokenCount": 2184}],"thoughtsTokenCount": 1881},"modelVersion": "gemini-4-argon","responseId": "NjXxar_YBba5wbUPv5vyyAo"}

